{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftTestKit and XCTestKit Core"}],"title":"characterDiffThreshold","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:11TestKitCore11DiffOptionsV09characterD9ThresholdSdSgvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"characterDiffThreshold"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"characterDiffThreshold"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":". Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" to disable collapsing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When comparing strings, if the percentage of changed characters exceeds"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this threshold, a string-to-string diff is performed instead of a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"character-by-character diff. For example, a threshold of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0.75"},{"text":" would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"collapse diffs where more than 75% of characters changed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is useful for avoiding noisy diff output when comparing unrelated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or significantly different strings, while preserving granular diffs for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typos and small changes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Consider the situation in which the expected string ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"12345\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"compared to the actual string ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"54321\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". 80% of the characters are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"considered to have changed, since only one of the five expected"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"characters (","type":"text"},{"code":"\"5\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") is present and in the correct position.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If collapsing is disabled, a character-by-character diff is performed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Specifically, the diff would report the following:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The leading ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"1234\""},{"type":"text","text":" in the expected string is missing."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"5\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the expected string is present and unchanged.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The actual string has an unexpected trailing ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"4321\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On the other hand, if collapsing is enabled and set to 75%, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"string-to-string diff is performed instead, since 80% exceeds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"threshold. The diff would simply indicate that the expected string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"12345\""},{"text":" is not equal to the actual string ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"54321\""},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/testkitcore\/diffoptions\/characterdiffthreshold"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore","doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/DiffOptions"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The threshold for collapsing character-level diffs."}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/DiffOptions\/characterDiffThreshold"},"references":{"doc://TestKitCore/documentation/TestKitCore/DiffOptions/characterDiffThreshold":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"characterDiffThreshold","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The threshold for collapsing character-level diffs."}],"url":"\/documentation\/testkitcore\/diffoptions\/characterdiffthreshold","title":"characterDiffThreshold","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/DiffOptions\/characterDiffThreshold"},"doc://TestKitCore/documentation/TestKitCore":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore","title":"SwiftTestKit and XCTestKit Core","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core types shared by SwiftTestKit and XCTestKit."}],"url":"\/documentation\/testkitcore"},"doc://TestKitCore/documentation/TestKitCore/DiffOptions":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/testkitcore\/diffoptions","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DiffOptions"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DiffOptions"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The options for computing diffs."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TestKitCore\/documentation\/TestKitCore\/DiffOptions","title":"DiffOptions"}}}